# Changelog

Versions are the `version` in `.claude-plugin/plugin.json`. Merging is releasing;
teammates pick a version up with
`/plugin update {{PROJECT_SLUG}}-shared@{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-context`.

## [0.1.0] - {{DATE}}

- Added `{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-context` — reads the knowledge base before work that depends
  on project facts.
- Added `{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-knowledge` — adds or updates a document in the owning
  workspace, with its index entry and its reviewer.
- Added `{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-links` — repairs broken links, non-kebab filenames and
  misrendering tables.
- Added `{{PROJECT_SLUG}}-space` — creates a workspace with exactly one owner and its
  area-map row.
